window.products.push({"id":726072,"name":"Alaska, Moose and Mountains, Double Exposure (9x12 Wall Art Print, Home Decor)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715czTEBTvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This original high-quality art print from Lantern Press boasts sharp detail and vivid imagery of Alaska, Moose and Mountains, Double Exposure (9x12 Wall Art Print, Home Decor). -Paper size measures 9 x 12 inches with an image size of 7.75 x 11.625 inches, ready for framing. -Printed on heavy stock paper using a high-end digital printing press. -Guaranteed color accuracy, durable imaging, and high print resolution. -Lantern Press art prints are designed and printed right here in the USA. Lantern Press incorporates our unique imagery with thoughtfully made keepsakes and gifts that delight our customers, connecting people to their memorable experiences.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715czTEBTvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lantern Press","source_asin":"B07RM6ZKFC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-726072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RM6ZKFC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RM6ZKFC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":726073,"name":"Villeroy & Boch French Garden Fleurence Gravy Boat, 10 oz, White/Multicolored","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":125.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wmtm042cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Serve and enjoy with French garden in a country style: delicious sauces are classically served on the festive table with the sauceboat in the charming French garden fleurence design. Its small handle ensures clean serving. Together with the matching saucer, it forms a beautiful duo. The sauce boat is also suitable for catering. Lastly, it can be carried with one hand, has shock- and impact-resistant edges and can be washed in the dishwasher. Amazon.com French Garden Fleurence dinnerware creates a look of informal elegance to complement any occasion or cuisine. Laurel leaf borders and scalloped edges set off a pastoral flower and fruit motif, while softly rounded lines add refinement. Soft green and buttery yellow hues are underglazed for a smooth finish and long-lasting beauty. Imported from Luxembourg and Germany, the high-quality vitrified porcelain is safe in the oven, dishwasher and microwave. This staple of the holiday table makes a graceful container for sauces, reductions, and glazes. Laurel leaf edging and a pair of soft green borders frame a cheerful design of clusters of fruit; the classic silhouette features a delicately arched handle and a tapered spout for dripless pouring. Pair with coordinating Fleurence tableware or mix with other patterns from Villeroy & Boch's French Garden lines for a look as dramatic as the countryside in Provence. The matching gravy boat stand is sold separately. Mary Park","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wmtm042cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Villeroy & Boch","source_asin":"B0000C8VNX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-726073","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000C8VNX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000C8VNX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
