window.products.push({"id":726165,"name":"BIG FOOT/YETI GUARDIAN BELL WITH CUSTOM GIFT BOX compatible with HARLEY BIKER BELL RIDE TO LIVE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31raFYEtLZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Comes with custom GIFT BOX Made in the USA Made of solid pewter 1 1/2 inches tall Includes Key Ring, Velveteen Bag and Legend Story The Legend: Legend has it Evil Road Spirits have been latching themselves on to motorcycles for as long as there have been bikes on the road. These Evil Road Spirits are responsible for mechanical problems and bad luck along a journey. Legend goes on to say that by attaching a small bell onto your bike, the Evil Road Spirits will become trapped inside the bell where the constant ringing drives them insane, making them lose their grip until they fall to the ground. (Ever wonder where pot-holes come from?) It is also believed that the mystery of the Guardian Bell carries twice as much power when it is purchased by a friend or loved one and given as a gift. Show someone how much you care. Offer them defense against the Evil Road Spirits! Give a Guardian Bell and share the Legend of Good Luck it offers to a motorcycle and its rider! All Guardian Bells are made of Lead Free Pewter in the USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31raFYEtLZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Guardian Bell","source_asin":"B075JNTPB5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-726165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075JNTPB5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075JNTPB5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
