window.products.push({"id":726188,"name":"BDI Novia 8424 Double Wide Enclosed Cabinet - Cocoa Stained Cherry (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dgdsAHkAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Low two-component wide cabinet is great for use in smaller spaces. Designed for use with up to a 50-Inch flat-panel or rear projection TV. With hidden wheels, flow-through ventilation and adjustable shelves, its high level of function and convenience matches its great looks. For use with flat panel or rear projection TVs up to 50-Inch. Fully assembled except for pulls and legs. 22.5-Inch H x 47-Inch W x 22-Inch D. From the Manufacturer The home theater has become a part of everyday home life. It’s where many hours are spent as family and friends come together for entertainment and relaxation. BDI Furniture merges innovative engineering and original design to seamlessly integrate today’s technology into the home. From the family room to the living room to the bedroom, there’s a BDI solution for any setting. The Novia 8424 features adjustable wood shelves that rest on threaded and cushioned shelf supports minimizing the transmission of vibrations IR-friendly grey tinted glass doors provide remote control access to components Fits flat-panel TVs up to 55\" While beautiful, BDI furniture is more than meets the eye. Our home theater furniture is among the most thoroughly engineered furniture available today, designed to anticipate the needs of the most demanding home theater systems. Features such as adjustable shelves, cable management, speaker/media storage and hidden wheels provide simple setup, ease of use and lasting enjoyment.  These home theater cabinets ship almost completely assembled, requiring only minimal hardware installation by the user or installer. Packaging is environmentally conscious and thoroughly designed to ensure that everything arrives as expected. Sleek Design And Intelligent Features – It’s The Center Of Entertainment The Novia 8424 is a great cabinet for smaller spaces. This cabinet features two component compartments with adjustable shelves. Flow-through ventilation slots are machined into the bottom panel, shelves and back panels to facilitate cooling airflow and protect components from overheating. The adjustable shelves rest on threaded and cushioned shelf supports to minimize transmission of vibrations. Quick-release door hinges, removable back panels and integrated cable management make for a simple setup. IR-friendly, grey tinted glass windows in the doors allow for easy remote control access. The hidden wheels allow the entire cabinet to be rolled away from the wall and integrated levelers compensate for uneven floors.  The Novia 8424 is the ideal choice for a flat panel TV (up to 50”) and small- to medium-sized home theater system, accommodating up to 6 components. For an alternative mounting option, this model works well with BDI’s Arena Flat Panel TV Mount 9972 (sold separately), which allows positioning the TV even higher and adds swiveling for optimal viewing. Novia 8424 Internal Dimensions Recommended TV Size: up to 50” flat-panel or rear projection TVs Recommended TV Size: up to 50” flat-panel or rear projection TVs Arena TV Mount Compatibility: 9972 Arena TV Mount Compatibility: 9972 Component Capacity:  4 - 6 Component Capacity: 4 - 6 Number of Adjustable Shelves: 2 Number of Adjustable Shelves: 2 Adjustable Shelf Increments: 1.25 in / 32 mm; 5 positions Adjustable Shelf Increments: 1.25 in / 32 mm; 5 positions Top Shelf Capacity: 150 lbs / 68 kg Top Shelf Capacity: 150 lbs / 68 kg Component Compartment Component Compartment Interior Dimensions (H x W x D): 16.25 x 19.75 x 19.25in D / 41 x 50 x 49 cm Adjustable Shelf Capacity: 50 lbs / 23 kg Bottom Shelf Capacity: 100 lbs / 45 kg What’s in the Box Furniture, Instruction Sheet","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dgdsAHkAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BDI Furniture","source_asin":"B002OEBM8E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-726188","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002OEBM8E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002OEBM8E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":726189,"name":"Niwo ART - Teal, 3-Piece Flower Canvas Wall Art Home Decor,Stretched Ready to Hang","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ts6PyIqbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"01 Teal Here are reasons You're Going to LOVE Your Niwo Art (TM) Canvas Prints: - Made in USA, Fast & free shipping. A perfect choice for wall decor at home and in office. Also makes a perfect gift. - 100% HANDMADE Each canvas print hand-stretched. Multiple sizes available.- State of the art Giclee print technology ensures the best quality, realizes an expanded range which enables greater overall balance and provides more vivid colors.- Pigment-based inks rather than other inks found in lower cost inkjets. Pigment-based inks have a longer life span that can last over 100 years without significant fading.- Acid free archival quality premium canvas.- Great wall decor art for living room, bedroom or lobby, makes a great a gift too.- Gallery Wrap. We are adding an extra 0.75-1.5 inch necessary for the borders using some pixels from the edges of your image and creating a border.- Real wood frame (Non-MDF) & Solvent-free Ink: odorless and can be used by someone with allergies and in kids' rooms.- Ready to hang. Hook is mounted inside of the frame so no gap visible between wall and the frame. Frame is wrapped very carefully in bubble or foam wrap to ensure safe shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ts6PyIqbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Niwo ART","source_asin":"B07HW2H51B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-726189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HW2H51B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HW2H51B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
