window.products.push({"id":726193,"name":"Pelvis Cookie Cutter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z-em-C8BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you have a custom shape or logos in mind please contact us for your unique custom orders. This listing is for Pelvis Cookie Cutter. The sizes are approximately as shown. great size to make cookies for any fun occasions. The depth are about 1/2” deep enough to make thick size cookies. All cookie cutters are made printed by a quality high resolution 70 microns 3D printer at the time of order. Most cookie cutters will probably be blue but color may vary. This item is not dishwasher safe, hand wash only. Prolonged exposure to moisture and direct sunlight should be avoided.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z-em-C8BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arbi Design","source_asin":"B073T7BYL9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-726193","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073T7BYL9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073T7BYL9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":726194,"name":"Cen-Tec Systems 95380 Aluminum Telescopic Wand and Combination Vacuum Floor Tool and Accessories Kit, Ratchet w, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71isMGGXdGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 41004 aluminum telescopic wand features a button lock top to hook onto hose handles, with a friction fit on the other end to slide into 1. 25 inch accessory tools. The compressed length is 23. 5” and extends to approximately 39”. The locking button onto the hose handle insures a tight fit and makes sure to stay tightly connected at the hose end. The lightweight aluminum construction is both light and durable. The wand is compatible with all standard 1. 25 inch diameter hose handles and attachments. The 37737 is a premium nozzle for both hard floor and carpeted surfaces. The tool is virtually silent when moving across hard floor surfaces due to the oversized wheel located just under the double pivot neck. The neck pivots first at the tool and then at the neck base to insure maximum cleaning performance. The 37737 is compatible with all canister vacuums, commercial back pack vacuums using 1. 25” accessories, and all major brands of central vacuum including Beam, Electrolux, Vacumaid, Cyclovac, MD, Vacuflo, Canavac, Nutone, Eureka, and Imperium. To confirm the 37737 consider the nozzle end of your wand or extension tube. If it has a connection without a button and measures approximately 1. 1/4” on the outside surface, it should be compatible. The 37737 is not compatible with several brands of European vacuums like Miele which require a 1. 375” neck. This package also includes dusting brush, crevice tool, and upholstery tool with natural fill slide on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71isMGGXdGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cen-Tec Systems","source_asin":"B089ZF5L32","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-726194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089ZF5L32","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089ZF5L32","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":726195,"name":"Gldbird Stainless Steel Salt and Pepper Grinder Refillable Glass Salt and Pepper Shakers (Tall)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AqBO2gCsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you still worried about the lack of fresh spices? We provide our best value products to all food lovers, gourmet chefs or creative gourmets who like to create gourmet cooking experiences in their own home kitchen. Gldbird pepper grinder feature a modern design and are stylish and elegant, It is an essential utensils on the kitchen and dining table. When you are camping or picnic, you can enjoy fresh spices according to your favorite taste. 【Features】 ——Easy to adjust the grind: Rotate clockwise to grind fine particles, rotate counterclockwise to grind coarse particles. ——Easy to clean: Just wipe the grinding device, the glass bottle can be washed with water. ——Easy To Refill: The transparent glass bottle can remind you to refill, just unscrew the stainless steel cap from the bottle to refill. ——Easy to carry: Salt and Pepper Shakers with lid, no need to worry about powder spilling, it can also prevent moisture and dust and keep it fresh for a long time. ——Wide range of applications: A variety of ingredients can be ground, such as pepper, mung bean, red bean, black pepper, white pepper, sea salt, cumin, sesame, etc. 【How to use】 1. Unscrew the stainless steel cap from the bottle. 2. Load the seasoning. 3. Screw on the cap. 4. Open the top lid and adjust the knob (do not overtighten). 5. Grinding. 【Specifications】 Color: As the picture shows Material: Stainless steel, Glass, Ceramic Size: Approx. 2.6 x 2.6 x 7.5 in Capacity: Approx.180 ml Package includes】 1 x Pepper Mill","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AqBO2gCsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"None Branded","source_asin":"B08GKXPJ1G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-726195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GKXPJ1G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GKXPJ1G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
