window.products.push({"id":726325,"name":"Epoca Silicone Tea Bag Buddy and Cup Cover Lid, 6-Pack, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812ISN6V8rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lukewarm messy tea is a no fun! When you are in the mood for a relaxing brew, the last thing you want to do is create a mess, or drink lukewarm tea! Here's the perfect tool to enhance your tea time or tea party experience! Epoca Silicone Tea Bag Buddy Weighed at just 0.8 ounces, a glance at this tiny piece of equipment's brilliant functionality will leave you amazed! The otherwise messy process of using tea bags becomes a cakewalk with this efficient tea buddy. It fits great over all kinds of mugs and cups, thereby trapping steam and keeping your tea hot. You can firmly secure the tea bag string in the tea bag buddy, then place it over your tea cup. Letting it steep in for as long as you want without worrying about the tea getting cold Ð or without fishing for the string inside your cup. For those who love strong tea, the buddy enables you to squeeze out the bag without creating a mess. It then goes on to be a used tea bag holder as well. Made of 100% non-staining and food-grade silicone, your fingers remain safe from the heat and your refreshing tea is ready to serve in no time! You can choose to order from the 1-pack, 2-pack, 3-pack, 6-pack, 10-pack or 50-pack versions. Order immediately!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812ISN6V8rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Epoca","source_asin":"B00I9N2ZV2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-726325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I9N2ZV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I9N2ZV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":726326,"name":"HerPro His and Hers Wine Tumbler Wedding Gifts for the Couple - Bridal Shower, Anniversary, Bachelorette - Champagne, Cocktail - Corkscrew, Double Ins","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CpIRtWodL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Does your tumbler retain odor and taste? You always bring your tumbler with you to the office because you love to have your favorite drink while working. Since you have so many favorite beverages and only one tumbler, it ends up smelling and tasting all sorts of crazy stuff. No matter how hard you soap or how long you soak it in hot water, your container still tastes and smells funky. You’ve made it a habit to buy a new one every couple of weeks, but it’s just gotten too absurd. With HerPro His and Hers Stainless Steel Wine Tumbler, your drinks’ flavor and aroma remain pure and fresh! These glasses come with lids, bent straws and a corkscrew. All are made of high-quality, pro-grade 18/8 stainless steel to protect against flavor transfer and to resist bacterial growth. They are also non-toxic, eco-friendly, 100% BPA-free and rust proof. With a scratch-resistant, powder-coated color finish, our tumblers have increased durability. This means that fading and chipping are reduced while keeping your hands safe and sweat free. If you enjoy camping, boating, picnics or the outdoors, you will love these beverage holders. They are perfect not only for wine but also for other cold drinks like cocktails, smoothies, milkshakes, champagne and beer, as well as for hot ones such as coffee and tea. Here are more reasons to love our wine tumblers: ✅ Dishwasher safe ✅ The laser printed texts don’t fade easily ✅ Meticulously packed for safe shipping ✅ Sturdy and unbreakable ✅ All you need for enjoying your favorite drinks is in this package! Enjoy a fresh-tasting drink any time of the day. Add HerPro His and Hers Stainless Steel Wine Tumbler to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CpIRtWodL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HerPro","source_asin":"B07J21CSKR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-726326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J21CSKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J21CSKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
