window.products.push({"id":726359,"name":"42 Collector NGC PCGS ICG Coin Slab Display Case Cabinet Holder Rack – Lockable, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":104.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rb4yMLSgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Hand made from imported Australian beech wood. This furniture grade Coin Slab Display case is of beautiful design and construction, very detailed and attractive, but also very affordable. Great way to display your special coins you have collected.   This unique display case features a black felt fabric background that creates a stunning contrast with your coins. Case holds up to 42 coin slabs, depending on which slabs you may have. Display case has 6 total shelves, each shelf has a over lip so your slabs do not tilt over.   Display case comes standard with a 98% UV Protection acrylic door, lockable latches with keys, and all hardware to mount the case to the wall. Comes fully assembled. (coins shown are not included). Unit Weight: 9 lbs. Dimensions: 28\"H X 16\"W X 1.75\"D Space between Shelves: 3 ¾”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rb4yMLSgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sfDisplay.com, Factory Direct Display Cases","source_asin":"B0043BTX5U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-726359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0043BTX5U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0043BTX5U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
