window.products.push({"id":726396,"name":"LAZCOZY Portable Air Conditioner Small Evaporative AC Unit With 3 Cooling Speeds Personal Mini Room Cooler With Type-C Input & 7 Colors Night Light Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NyJ7XxGJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3-in-1 Personal Air Conditioner】This small unit is a combination of Air Conditioner, Fan and Humidifier. It can turn [Hot&Dry Air] into [Cold&Refreshing Air] in seconds with the latest evaporation technology. The Mini room AC lets you create your own personal comfort zone in your home or work office, garage, RV camper, dorm room. 【Type-C Input &Portable Size】This mini room cooler is equipped with Type C power supply system to provide a safer power input. You can use the Type c power cable included in the package to connect adapter, power bank, computer or car charger. The compact size and the retractable handle make this cooler suitable for anywhere, even the travel! 【Low Noise】 According to the \"NIOSH Sound Level Meter\" App test, the noise level of this portable AC at level 1 is only 36dB. This is 42% lower than NIOSH Recommended Exposure Limit. Even at levels 2 and 3, the noise of this air cooler is only 53 dB and 57 dB. This noise level is almost the lowest among similar personal air conditioner. 【3 Cooling Speeds & 7 Colors Mood Light】 LAZOCZY air cooler has 3 cooling levels and 7 selectable night lights. [Level 1] and [Level 2] for 15 sq.ft and 30 sq.ft area. [Level 3] for 45 sq.ft like your office, garage or RV camper. There is also a humidifier technology for LAZCOZY air conditioners that can do the water in an ultra fine spray. 【Lower Energy Consumption & Safety】 The air conditioner with evaporation technology up to 90% less energy than conventional air conditioners. The air conditioner with water for naturally cooled and humidified air, without any harmful chemicals. It has passed certifications according to FCC, ROHS, CE , MSDS and air conditioning system is made of BPA-free material, guarantees the health of children and adults.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NyJ7XxGJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAZCOZY","source_asin":"B093H4W77B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-726396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093H4W77B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093H4W77B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":726397,"name":"Devine Accessories Red Wine Aerator – One-of-a-Kind Self Standing Goblet Shaped Decanter with Built in Drip Stand for Leak and Mess Free Aeration in S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710kNDeFKRS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Any wine enthusiast knows that a little breathing can be the difference between good wine and great wine. While a glass of red wine is great on its own, letting it breathe through aeration is essential to bringing out its full flavor and aroma. But who has hours to wait for that to happen? Here at DeVine Accessories we have created the perfect tool to help you bring out the best in your wine in seconds right at your dinner table - the Goblet Wine Aerator! PRODUCT FEATURES DeVine Patented Aeration Process 3 Stage Method Aerates Wine As You Pour Goblet Shaped for Easy Use and Convenience Drip Collector to Reduce Mess ULTIMATE SIMPLICITY Most aerators use an ineffective single stage process to aerate wine. Our Goblet Wine Aerator goes the extra mile and adds two additional crucial steps to make sure your wine is enhanced with fuller flavor and a smoother finish in a fraction of the time. Along with its compact design, aeration no longer has to be a tedious task that you have to plan ahead of time in order to enjoy a glass - simply bring it with you to the dinner table and aerate your wine on the spot! Just pour your wine through the aerator, and voila! Fresher, tastier, smoother wine in just a matter of seconds! CLASSY YET FUNCTIONAL APPEARANCE If you thought that our aerator was made to look like fancy wine goblet just for show, then you're terribly mistaken! As fancy and classy as it appears, the detachable stem and sleek design are there to provide you with the utmost convenience. While the shape of the aerator can easily stand right on any surface for anyone to use in an instant, the stem acts as a drip collector so you can rely on less messes! Sit back and use our Goblet Wine Aerator for classier, tastier, and an overall better wine experience!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710kNDeFKRS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Agog DeVine Accessories","source_asin":"B01183TVNO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-726397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01183TVNO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01183TVNO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
