window.products.push({"id":726601,"name":"mingshang Electronic Measuring Spoon Scale 0.1g High Precision Household Kitchen Baking Spoon Digital LCD Scale 500g Capacity Weighing White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jF48HdLDL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Digital spoon scales are new type of ideal with the characteristics of handsome, compact size, appearance. It’s reliable performance of multifunction, weighing accuracy makes them to be in family, drug stores and Science lab etc.  Ideal tool to weighing butter,flour,cream,tea or spices during cooking baking. weighing tea leaves weighing coffee weighing seasonings weighing medicinal materials  Specifications: Digital spoon scale with LCD display. Function:Tare Function; Unit Switch Function; Hand lock function.Auto power off. Unit conversions:g/oz/gn/ct With Tare,lower battery,overload indication Material:with ABS environment protect material Capacity:500g*0.1g High precision strain guage sensor system,precision:0.1g  The scoop is with volume measuring marking,0-30ml  Dimension:230*86*30mm Powered by 1pcs CR2032 battery （Not include）  Using Method: 1) Power Button: Press Button”ON/OFF” to boot after handling the spoon scale In the horizontal position. After System self-test, display “0.0g” or “0.00oz’, which conveying into the weighing state and you can start weighing. When the power on, Press Button “ON/OFF” all the while to shut off.  2)Tare Function Button: When placing containers or bags into the scoop of the spoon scale, Press Button ‘TARE” to minus the tare back the screen display to zero; If there is no items in weighing scoop, press Button “TARE” for Zero correction function, the screen displays zero for starting weighing. 3)Lock Function Button: When the display is static, Press Button “HOLD” to lock and display the weighing value; 4)Unit Switch Button: Press Button “MODE” for changing the weighing Unit among “g” ,\"oz\",\"gn\", and “ct”.  Package Content： 1Pc x Manual  1 x Electronic Measuring Spoon","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jF48HdLDL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mingshang","source_asin":"B07C96Z3NH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-726601","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C96Z3NH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C96Z3NH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
