window.products.push({"id":726629,"name":"Crystalia Decorative Turkish Ceramic Serving Bowl Set of 6, Handmade Multicolor Dipping Charcuterie Bowls (Medium-6PCs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+JU9nkPvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SMALL PREP BOWLS & BIG JOBS & PERFECT RESULTS We bet on these mini bowls will be one of your best friends/helpers in your kitchen. Firstly, you can use them as charcuterie bowls for keeping your ingredients handy. These soy sauce bowls are not only great for measuring ingredients while cooking or baking but also can be used as trifle dishes, salsa bowls, custard cups, and salad dressing bowls. Condiment bowls are used to hold spices and are an aesthetic way to serve condiments. Ingredient bowls also are often used to hold chopped vegetables, especially smaller ones like garlic, scallions, and ginger. Olives, pickles, lemon wedges, and other side dishes can be served nicely in pinch bowls. Also, it is the perfect choice to serve honey, jam, sweets, biscuits, fruits, and dried fruits at home or at an event. MADE IN EUROPE & HANDMADE & HAND DECORATED & HAND-PAINTED: These colorful tiny bowls are delicately handcrafted, hand-painted, and hand-decorated in Europe-Turkey. Unlike those made in China ones, these condiment bowls are made of high-quality ceramic with delicate workmanship. PERFECT GIFT & ASSORTED COLORS SET of 6 PCs: Every set includes a red, blue, green, yellow, black, and white bowl. Thanks to their stylish authentic design these decorative bowls are perfect for Christmas, birthday gifts, wedding parties, Valentine’s Day, anniversaries, Father’s Day, Mother's Day, housewarming, St. Patrick’s Day, and secret Santa gifts! EASY TO CLEAN & DISHWASHER SAFE: Our ceramic dish set is durable, stackable, and easy to clean up in the dishwasher. Even if it is suitable for cleaning in a dishwasher, we recommend handwashing to use it in the same bright form for a long time. SPECIFICATIONS: - Product Capacity: 8.45 Fl Oz (250 ml)- Product Size: Height: 2\" (50 mm), Diameter: 5 1/8\" (130 mm).- Material: Nontoxic High-Quality Ceramic","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+JU9nkPvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crystalia","source_asin":"B0B3QHTK8G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-726629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3QHTK8G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3QHTK8G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
