window.products.push({"id":726957,"name":"Andvon Electric Lunch Box 80W Food Heater, 1.8L Larger Capacity Heated Lunch Boxes for Adults, 3-In-1 Portable for Car & Home/Office,Heatable Lunch Bo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KLgf+mxvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💞【3 IN 1 ELECTRIC LUNCH BOX】No Need to looking for a microwave and wait in line for heating, The electric heating lunch boxes for on the go includes two different cables-110V&24V, 24V adapter can be use for CAR and TRUCK. 110V for heated food at the office or home.Self warming Lunch boxes heat up your food and keep constant heating between 60°C and 70°C when plugging in, always serving you a hot meal. 💞【HEAT UP FAST】The portable car warmer food heater supply 80w power, Different from the old version of the electric lunch box, the heating speed of the new version of the electric lunchbox is 1/3 faster than that of the old one.Get it plugged 20-40mins before mealtime for self heating, you can heat up a healthy food in no time.Say goodbye to boring sandwiches.Tip:Adding some water for heating up food faster and evenly. 💞【1.8L Large Capacity】Andvon 1.8L electric lunchboxes is the latest large-capacity lunch box. The capacity of our portable food warmer lunch box has reached 1.8L (20 % more than others). Don't worry about not having enough food anymore. You're just minutes away from \"Super satisfied\". 💞【IMPROVED SEALING LID】The portable hot lunch box for adults lid is installed leak-proof seal gasket for a better seal to prevent liquid food spill out during bumps. For closing the cover properly and smoother, please lock the short snaps first and then lock the long snaps. Do not turn the lunchbox upside down to avoid liquid leak out from the steam port on the lid. 💞【Package List】Andvon electric lunchbox food heater includes: 1x 1.8L electric lunch box, 1x leak-proof seal ring, 1x SS spoon & fork, 1x 304 stainless steel inner continer-Capacity 1.8L, 1x additional plastic compartment,1x 24V power cord for cars/trucks, 1x 110V for home/office use,1x lunch carry bag. 💞【Best Gift To Men】The heated Lunch Boxes for adults allows your family and friends to enjoy warm and healthy food in the office, in the hospital, in the construction site for men heavy duty, or in the car/truck. It is the best choice as a gift. 💞【EASY TO CLEAN】Andvon portable heated lunchbox made of premium PP plastic and 304 stainless steel, which is safe and durable. Contains a 1.8L removable stainless steel container and a 0.45L plastic box for fruit storage, they are dishwasher safe. Included stainless steel fork and knife,Great value for money.❥❥Note: Don't add liquld to the heating base of the lunch box to avoid short circuit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KLgf+mxvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Andvon","source_asin":"B0BY4455BJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-726957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY4455BJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY4455BJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
