window.products.push({"id":726979,"name":"OlarHike Black Shelves for Bedroom Wall, 4 Pack Floating Wall Shelves for Kids Books Storage, Wall Mounted Rustic Wood Floating Shelf for Living Room ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lpwsOU3nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RUSTIC U-SHAPED SHELVES: The floating set of rustic wall-mounted u-shaped shelves is a great idea if you want to incorporate storage into your room, without the cluttered look that often comes with it. These floating wall shelves come in a simple and rustic design, and our wall shelves are made of solid paulownia wood for strength and durability. These floating wall shelves are perfect for those living spaces or rooms where floor space feels limited! MULTIPURPOSE FLOATING SHELVES: These wall-mounted U-shaped shelves are perfect for displaying and holding your collectibles, plants, valuables or anything else you want to show off. Wall-mounted u shaped shelving is a space saving way of displaying the things that matter most in life while still allowing room on other surfaces for more items! DIFFERENT SIZE DISPLAY SHELVES: Varying sizes of floating shelves not only provide ample room but also add to the fun and rustic look. This hanging shelf has a unique U-Shape that adds extra space for a more personal touch in your office or living area. L: 16.5*4.7*3.9in, M: 14.2*4.7*3.4in, S: 11.8*4.7*2.8in, XS: 9.8*4.7*2.2in STURDY WALL SHELVES: Durable paulownia wood shelves are a rustic and natural choice for your home. These wood floating wall shelves have the perfect clear texture to show off any features you may have on the display such as paintings or small sculptures in need of some extra attention! WHAT YOU GET: 4 sets of U-shaped floating shelves with max weight capacity: 40lb. Our floating shelf set comes with hardware such as screws and wall anchors. These wall-mounted shelving units are easy to install, all the necessary hardware is preinstalled on each board, so there's no need for drilling holes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lpwsOU3nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OlarHike","source_asin":"B097933NNX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-726979","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097933NNX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097933NNX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
